{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_title", "source_sha256": "1089dbfba48953ad5353280c1dfa76125253eda4aa35998ec04e407cc96e5ad7", "ja": "キラキラの毎日、キラキラの明日", "zh": "闪亮的每天，耀眼的明天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2daa370bad9b04569fc87a18322b3226877c832f4fee74872c034fda9dd6b750", "ja": "次回公演のセンターに指名されたものの、気\n乗りしない様子の翼。しかし、通りかかった\n美希がセンターに立候補したことで突然やる\n気モードに。レッスンはサボりがちなまま、\nそのセンスで無事に公演を乗りきる。", "zh": "翼虽然被指定为下次公演的Center，\n却一副兴趣缺缺的样子。然而在路过的美希\n表示自己也想当Center后，翼突然变得充满\n干劲。尽管练习时常常偷懒，她仍凭借着天分\n顺利完成公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4545d5f2cec757c7c90587a19fa06547791a77b1a387080e12836e76582f3b37", "ja": "（次の公演に向けてのレッスンが始まった。\nさて、翼の様子はどうかな？）", "zh": "（以下次公演为目标的练习开始了，\n来看看翼的状况如何。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "9dc23b5b26139b24778e023b4151bc4a8640df225a3fa0ca2908ddeb3204fe2a", "ja": "翼。\n次の公演、センターに決まったんですって？", "zh": "翼。\n听说你被选为下次公演的Center？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "1614454176f6a0ddc6c74dab37ab0471eb0af17b4f1eddc690ce22fe4f390775", "ja": "やったね、翼♪\n私、次は絶対、翼だと思ったんだ！", "zh": "太好了，翼♪\n我就知道下一个一定是你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "394761bb2f39decad1f2fc5a67310e74b7951e94fe909b4bcac055f8b686124d", "ja": "ん～……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "26945b33e7f3f3807d9e061966f8f968b0031a023b022f6478f50321ff9e1c2d", "ja": "どうしたの？\nなんだか、嬉しくなさそうだけど……。", "zh": "怎么回事？\n总觉得你没有很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "fbe0d4d6774d7eb5dd7c06119ae55b3862426fb76fd1b777f7972d51cdd0b081", "ja": "ええっ！？　そんなわけないよ、静香ちゃん！\nだってセンターだよ、センター！", "zh": "咦咦！？小静，她怎么可能会不开心！\n是当Center喔，Center！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "5e4fbb1f425daf50d39bb74eba8b87e3d51a504f8f4d5f94c1e087655f6066ac", "ja": "ステージの真ん中で、中心で、とにかくえーっと、\nセンターになるのはすごいことなんだもん！", "zh": "站在舞台的正中央、中心点，该怎么说呢～\n总之成为Center，是件很不得了的事耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "57f91068519b8039d3aba984ffc384b8c71fa861e27dd068c5e4e33238354111", "ja": "え、ええ。……そうよね。翼だって、\nアイドルとしてトップを目指しているんですもの。", "zh": "是、是啊，说得没错……\n翼也是以成为顶尖偶像为目标吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "1096e53b6cb887b4c1fbe3934466a6010060160306b25a57249694f91f9bc680", "ja": "なのに、センターがイヤだなんて。\nそんなこと、あるはず……。", "zh": "但却讨厌当Center……\n应该不是这样吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0d60be603e248c9c7390f11c9087aface9cab85fea4b1606f7e54f7304b55cb4", "ja": "うん。\nわたし、センターはイヤじゃないよ？", "zh": "嗯。\n我不讨厌当Center喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "2996b97d0245ca30f24a3ad2f0e6ce3a0ba97769b2792963b4b543767278a086", "ja": "そ、そうよね。\nよかった……。", "zh": "就、就是说啊。\n太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "56da36d77bc95436d249c32f43c2c524acab09b7f63917c81d13632cd8e9c3f2", "ja": "（よかった……）", "zh": "（太好了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "27cf650332041f517f8011ff7144536c4a031c6aed904830ed3a3c571be09048", "ja": "そうよ……いよいよ、翼がセンターなんだもの。\n私も、今まで以上に気合いを入れてレッスンしなきゃ！", "zh": "没错……终于轮到翼当Center了呢。\n我也得比之前更认真练习才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4f44c2b8d34d25d8b92db43bd49cf62e3f40d5de927f76379eb63a428657b55a", "ja": "レッスンかぁ～……。", "zh": "练习啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "0c3a4e715fa05781303d5592847e7d7ce57c81b6889d5c00548f037158349215", "ja": "うんうん♪　翼、わからないことがあったら、\n何でも聞いてね！　私、この前センターやったから！", "zh": "嗯嗯♪翼，要是有什么不懂的地方，\n都可以问我喔！因为我之前有当过Center！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "24619a977cc04a3c0859d8015cf2d8d08389a0f242631e7d535ccebe955e6058", "ja": "未来……あなた、\nセンターの経験は1回だけでしょ……。", "zh": "未来……\n你只当过一次Center吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "37a0aa8e83ea01c6e2872ed51c06098c289def5bdb24411bf451f6387bed9a3d", "ja": "い、1回でも、経験は経験だもん！\nそれを言うなら、静香ちゃんだっておんなじ！", "zh": "一、一次也是有当过呀！\n这样说来，小静也一样啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1017_015siz", "source_sha256": "ffe5c5cf0ae36f7ac67325219db1957f472688ebdcbb07c7c585210f02d8457b", "ja": "そうよ。\nだから、私に教えられることなんて、特には……。", "zh": "没错。\n所以我没什么可以教翼的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "e0f37b010e517eb3195dfe542122de8b56dfde0b83ad3294291a2a049887cd2a", "ja": "翼？", "zh": "翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1020_p", "source_sha256": "57f748ec6d9fae21341b076f067a80a9c7410d6c5123a9a804be048be0e458c0", "ja": "（翼、レッスンに集中できてないみたいだな。\nどうしたんだ？）", "zh": "(翼好像没办法专心练习，\n这是怎么回事？)", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1021_se", "source_sha256": "340b907fd6010c8c2f9bbbc531a632570164cb26d32b3873a04e514d7f8c49c3", "ja": "ピリリリリ……", "zh": "叮铃铃铃铃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1022_014mir", "source_sha256": "6296dc8d17381767867ed88c31c27e561b30fa0c1aa5f42be983f06bc7666a7f", "ja": "あれ？　もう、こんな時間？\nレッスンルーム使っていいの、あと1時間だっけ？", "zh": "咦？已经这么晚了？\n这样练习室是不是只能再用一小时？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "943c1bf1af3cdf7b1bb99921cf002bb34ca43d64f950d479fce63cbacde7b1b1", "ja": "えっ……やだ、本当！\nレッスンの時間がなくなっちゃう！", "zh": "咦……糟糕，真的！\n快没时间练习了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0f5b271fca3c0906c9226afafbed5cc9d82ef7e132e049d9d095340b0ed3d920", "ja": "あっ、ホントだ～。\nもうこんな時間なんだ～？", "zh": "啊，真的耶～\n已经这个时间啦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "81c14e27a120e5b9fc8dd02aed99acaf1e6d7546c754f61c2f5484ce283076b7", "ja": "それじゃ、ふたりとも、お疲れさまでした！\nわたし、今日のところは帰りま～す♪", "zh": "既然这样，你们两个辛苦了！\n我今天要先回去了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "54be2990ee8a3b10c8c4e9dd771fde9f9895a15c71469ca16f1f139f3b9ff3e2", "ja": "えっ……ええっ！？\n翼、帰っちゃうの！？", "zh": "咦……咦咦！？\n翼，你要回去了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1027_015siz", "source_sha256": "374858fab4a055dab67762a8e9453587cb91e1eb76f4810531f6812a2fa967b0", "ja": "ちょっと、翼！？\nあなた、まだ何もしてないじゃないの！", "zh": "等等，翼！？\n你什么都还没练到喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1028_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5a6a5c0b4e60f7d6ff2e04f36a1da271bf869d2b3c1780024335c3ebdf7b00c5", "ja": "だって今からレッスンしてたら、遅くなっちゃうし～。\n早く帰って、テレビ観ないと♪", "zh": "可是如果现在开始练习，回去就太晚了～\n我得早点回去看电视♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1029_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5a0959ef5629cbf51a4bb3a8503cc4379f0f78622f9bd35fb23ef09291facb12", "ja": "そーいうワケだから、未来、静香ちゃん、\nまた明日ね～♪", "zh": "所以啰，未来、小静，\n我们明天见～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_1030", "source_sha256": "515a7e04415e9792fefe8ca108ade0927a9bdebb579f34e92c7bac57539faee4", "ja": "こら！", "zh": "等等！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "140967ef3f582088044813c9c565a34eb279bf246e23706884f7cdadb08b6e6d", "ja": "こら、翼！", "zh": "等等，翼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "40ac8f240ba7ac607de78a8be909eda5951893ecec93a01cbf9f980b85294bb4", "ja": "キャッ！\n……あれ、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "呀！\n……咦，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "3afa739224931d20329463499215796383e02fe273971a8c4f471387103f4f23", "ja": "さっきから見てたぞ。\nちっともレッスンしてないじゃないか。", "zh": "我全都看到啰。\n你根本没有练习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8c777627ef512b1244071b88012365f4eccde1ee7fb31ed1f8253f5f5e4deb0a", "ja": "え～？　そうでしたっけ～？", "zh": "咦～？是这样吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2004_p", "source_sha256": "8a33a91926b65e22f5689a0d5707228f65d64f78ece21609ddc1c6846642dae3", "ja": "そうだ。まったく、ごまかされないからな。\nほら、レッスンに戻って……。", "zh": "就是这样。伤脑筋耶，不要想蒙混过去。\n快点回去练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "25e1836f07998af4f3002d73318e06f6b4a499ec0c0b148fdfeff3906f4788bb", "ja": "も～。そんなに心配しなくても大丈夫ですよ、\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "真是的～你不用那么担心啦，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "278447ed5f2b2eb39053caac2232e4c7a583d91938fe88ae8a4df075a93e75dc", "ja": "レッスンなんて、そんなにいっぱいしなくても！\nだってわたし、もう全部覚えちゃったもん♪", "zh": "不用练那么多也没关系啦！\n反正我全都已经记住了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2007_p", "source_sha256": "69b348c74a46d2dcca3d66ecba47d1a1ec7bb3bee9c63847a73ca1c2ac7d88a9", "ja": "いや、そういう問題じゃなくてな……。", "zh": "不，问题不在这……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
