{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2013_p", "source_sha256": "53af97dd715f21d94ff76ecb3d09cd473ee22be41e25e53df01ddbd5bfefabe2", "ja": "まあ、その予定だったんだけどな。\nちょっと予定変更というか……。", "zh": "是啊，本来是这么打算的。\n但现在可能会有点变动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2014_003mik", "source_sha256": "f65bad74ad85679b0b482f6f986391120568474fe37a31769309d4919f3b2519", "ja": "あはっ、わかったの！\nきっと翼が、レッスンサボったんだよね？", "zh": "啊哈，美希知道唷！\n一定是因为翼偷懒不练习对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "27ce8936511d5a9180dd03821e913f5ebda1809b99c29e534115dcd020032c46", "ja": "ま、まだサボってないですよ～。\nちょっと、早く帰ろうとしただけで……。", "zh": "我、我才没偷懒呢～\n只是准备早点回家而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2016_015siz", "source_sha256": "03255c88609a6a4b205538c8317969237211b9a89b1711d6090c019ec51e47eb", "ja": "もう、翼ったら。\nその前から、全然レッスンしてなかったじゃない。", "zh": "翼真是的。\n你在那之前不是也完全没练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2017_014mir", "source_sha256": "469ef7b8fec37cd62ac156acaba6731413f452c8d0e266c2994652c375d5420b", "ja": "ていうか、どうしてわかるの、美希ちゃん？", "zh": "话说回来，美希怎么会知道？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2018_003mik", "source_sha256": "880725e7a24eea66cf8df736c04619704b6c6bc21081fd60c03715348b35b61e", "ja": "だって、ミキもいっぱいサボったから♪\nそういうの、なんとなく感じるってカンジ！", "zh": "因为美希也常常偷懒啊♪\n多多少少可以猜得到的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2019_014mir", "source_sha256": "c48dd4bd4b19de5d590f91635e59beae255f274619379562f6aa76867e2f6e54", "ja": "わぁ、すごーい！", "zh": "哇，好厉害──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2020_p", "source_sha256": "c9c850dcbe0b2a558968b549c7f5de6644dd523c5fc6ffbb5b15c6421130629f", "ja": "すごくないぞ。……それより、翼。\n劇場のセンター、やりたくないのか？", "zh": "一点都不厉害……先不说这个。\n翼，你不想当剧场的Center吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c39b720b3a6cce278e8ae7ca669901616f55d9a68c59c86f1b98774ac3148fd0", "ja": "えっ？\n別に、やりたくないわけじゃないですけど～。", "zh": "咦？\n也不是不想当啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
