{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e054047be2aeab7d62c6df691366f01c061d442c048ee9733aab7d7efb8699d6", "ja": "いつもよりたくさんレッスンしなきゃいけないなら、\nセンターとか別にいいかなって！", "zh": "如果得比平常做更多练习，\n那我觉得不当Center也无所谓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_003_2024_015siz", "source_sha256": "25b5919f8882d8925c3f12b4e04ea5d21e11834e9fdcb41d6ee2c59b25a2446b", "ja": "ちょっ……翼！\n何を言って……！", "zh": "等一下……翼！\n你在说什么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
